+
+#### [docTR](https://github.com/mindee/doctr)
+> **Description:** `docTR` positions itself as a high-performing and accessible document text recognition library powered by deep learning. The README emphasizes OCR-related tasks, model-backed text detection and recognition, and installable Python workflows for modern document pipelines. For accountants, that matters when invoices, receipts, and scanned statements are too messy for regex-only tools and need a model-driven extraction layer first. GitHub lists `docTR` as Apache-2.0 licensed, primarily Python, at 5.7k stars, with repository activity visible on Nov 23, 2025.
+
+- **GitHub:** [github.com/mindee/doctr](https://github.com/mindee/doctr)
+- **Stars:** 5.7k ⭐
+- **Language:** Python
