+
+#### [PaddleOCR](https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR)
+> **Description:** `PaddleOCR` describes itself as a production-ready OCR and document AI engine that turns PDFs and images into structured, AI-friendly data such as JSON and Markdown. The README highlights multilingual OCR, table extraction, key information extraction, and structured document parsing, which maps directly to invoices, tax notices, bank letters, and scanned financial records. It is one of the largest and most active repos in this space, with Apache-2.0 licensing, Python as the primary language, 66.5k stars, and a GitHub update date of Mar 26, 2026.
+
+- **GitHub:** [github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR](https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR)
+- **Stars:** 66.5k ⭐
