+#### [Unstructured](https://github.com/Unstructured-IO/unstructured)
+> **Description:** `Unstructured` is framed in its README as an open-source ETL layer for converting complex documents into clean, structured formats for language models. That is useful for accountants who need to normalize vendor contracts, policy binders, statements, board packs, or audit support PDFs before downstream search or extraction. The project covers partitioning, cleaning, chunking, and connectors, which makes it a strong pre-processing component rather than a narrowly scoped OCR tool. GitHub shows 13.5k stars, HTML as the primary language, Apache-2.0 licensing, and an update date of Dec 30, 2025.
+
