+> **Description:** `Marker` is described by its maintainers as a fast, high-accuracy PDF-to-Markdown and JSON converter. That makes it especially useful when accountants need to feed reports, policies, accounting memos, or tax guidance into an internal knowledge base or chatbot with minimal manual cleanup. It sits between raw OCR and final copilot layers, converting dense documents into formats that are easier to search, chunk, and audit. GitHub lists the project with 30.9k stars, Python as the primary language, GPL-3.0 licensing, and an update date of Jan 7, 2026.
