+
+> The best AI tools for accountants in 2026 are increasingly open source, self-hosted, and GitHub-first. This list focuses only on public GitHub repositories that accountants, finance teams, consultants, and builders can inspect, run, extend, and audit for invoice processing, forecasting, anomaly detection, SQL analysis, and workflow automation.
