+## Why This List
+Most pages ranking for "best AI tools for accountants 2026" mix SaaS products, affiliate lists, and tools with little transparency. This repository does the opposite: every entry here has a public GitHub repository, current GitHub metadata, and a concrete reason an accounting team might actually use it.
+
+Open source matters for accountants because financial workflows often involve invoices, ledgers, payroll exports, audit evidence, tax workpapers, and other sensitive records. Self-hostable and inspectable tools make it easier to control data residency, review model behavior, automate repeatable processes, and avoid black-box vendor lock-in.
