+### Forecasting and Anomaly Detection
+
+#### [Chronos Forecasting](https://github.com/amazon-science/chronos-forecasting)
+> **Description:** `Chronos` provides pretrained time-series forecasting models that support zero-shot forecasting across different forecasting setups. The README explains the Chronos family, including Chronos-2 and Chronos-Bolt, and positions the project around pretrained models, efficient inference, and strong benchmark performance. For accountants, this is useful for demand, revenue, collections, and cash forecasting when teams want a model-heavy approach instead of purely classical stats. GitHub lists the repo as Apache-2.0 licensed, primarily Python, with 4.5k stars and a visible update date of Nov 11, 2025.
